# WiFi secret (template) — copy this file to `wifi_secret.env` and fill it in.
#
# `wifi_secret.env` is gitignored. At build time, main/CMakeLists.txt reads it and
# bakes these into the firmware as the *default* STA credentials, used ONLY when NVS
# has no stored network (e.g. a fresh flash or after `idf.py erase-flash`). Anything
# you set later via the SETUP -> WI-FI panel or the /cmd wifi API is stored in NVS and
# takes precedence. Leave blank to bake in no default (the unit comes up AP-only).
#
# Format: KEY=VALUE or KEY: VALUE (so a plain .env or simple YAML both work).
# NOTE: the password is compiled into the image in plaintext — fine for a dev prop,
# but that's why this file is gitignored. Don't commit real credentials.

SSID=
PASS=
